{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Part of #148. Depends on the views fetch.\n\n- Columns come from `verticalGroupByFields` — any single-select or iteration field, in the field's option order, plus a `No <field>` column — instead of the hard-coded `Status`.\n- `groupByFields` renders horizontal swimlanes (one band per value, collapsible with `Space`).\n- `sortByFields` orders the cards inside a column.\n- Card rendering (type glyph, number, title, assignees, `owner/repo` for foreign items) is unchanged.","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T03:06:04Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":151,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: Board layout with the view's column field and swimlanes"}
